    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c879cf15abbf1eee547c640",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "认真地不断努力，却仍在压倒性的强者面前败北。\n对于这样的她来说『唯一的长处』这句话，果然还是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "da7e5a165d624ea83d333c6ed7e7252b2f23f9f424acf7253999b418f661b5b2",
