      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主，依旧如平时般冷静。\n……也正因如此，她用不容置疑的口吻断然说道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba3fcee83139a0d1291536a4dd7e95aef533eea831cfb23f59ad2670ac75143f",
