      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，正因为如此，我才能。\n――踏实地，稳健地，一步一步地，朝着荣耀奋勇前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e1fe47c1c7cee2228afdf7e05ba0697dbd980ddf59b962d704400fb4d1a51f",
